ug": "ragnarok-zero-global--1", "summary": "Rediscover the original excitement of Midgard as Ragnarok Zero\u2019s exclusive UI and simple controls allow all types of players, both new and seasoned, to easily and enjoyably experience the classic Ragnarok journey.\n\nRagnarok Zero: Global presents an evolved gameplay experience that sets itself apart from the original, including Ragnarok\u2019s first-ever UGC content, localized maps, and Zero-exclusive episodes.\n\nOperating under a subscription-based model designed for the PC MMORPG experience, Ragnarok Zero: Global focuses on balanced progression and long-term gameplay while preserving the spirit of the original Ragnarok.\n\nAs the first-ever Ragnarok PC title with a single global client, the game features seven in-game languages and provides a seamless global service connecting Europe, Southeast Asia, and Oceania.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/ragnarok-zero-global--1", "videos": [{"id": 191182, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "3ZU9vHF098I", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3ZU9vHF098I", "title": "Ragnarok Zero: Global Official Pre-Registration Trailer!", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3ZU9vHF098I/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 2016, "name": "Ragnarok Online"}]}